\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Decision-flip rates by system. \textbf  {Trials} is the number of modifier trials per model: 7,600 for each LLM. Rows marked $\ddagger $ are served through provider APIs, the rest run locally; models are ordered by flip rate. Note that sensitivity is not monotonic in capability: the small Haiku 4.5 is the most sensitive LLM, whereas the frontier Sonnet 5 is among the least. See \ref  {sec:human-study} for the human-pilot trial procedure.\relax }}{6}{table.caption.5}\protected@file@percent }
